Z||000002||Will||11-18-2000||09:54 PM||||My father has one of these engines in a '75 Datsun 280Z. It's makes a fun ride.<BR>Externally, the engine is exactly like an LT1 (give or take a few casting numbers).<BR>IOW, it will not be any easier to swap in than an LT1.<BR>     It only has about 200 hp, but a nice amount of low end torque.||||reg||1
